OL,3,GNEWSATeen e-bike rider seriously hurt
OL,4,Ain crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage e-bike rider has suffered
OL,7,Fserious head injuries in a crash with a
OL,8,Fcar.
OL,10,FThe collision between a Sur-Ron bike
OL,11,Fand a Vauxhall Corsa happened on
OL,12,FLongridge Road, Ribbleton, Preston, at
OL,13,Fthe junction with Chatburn Road, at
OL,14,Fabout 21:20 BST on Sunday, Lancashire
OL,15,FPolice said.
OL,17,FA 19-year-old man was taken to
OL,18,Fhospital, it added. The driver of the
OL,19,Fcar and a passenger suffered minor
OL,20,Finjuries.
